# Allow-list: ignore everything, then include only the shareable config.
# Secrets and machine state (auth.json, mcp-auth.json, settings.json,
# sessions/) live in ~/.pi/agent and must never be added here.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!install.sh
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!settings.example.json
!AGENTS.md
!mcp.json
!agents/
!agents/*.md
!prompts/
!prompts/*.md
!extensions/
!extensions/**
!sandbox/
!sandbox/Dockerfile
!sandbox/pi-sandbox
!.github/
!.github/**
